<title>USA: Affiliated Community sets 25 pct stk div.</title>
<headline>Affiliated Community sets 25 pct stk div.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affiliated Community Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it had set a 25 percent stock dividend, payable May 30, record May 15.</p>
<p>Affiliated said the 25 percent increase in the number of shares outstanding will enhance the liquidity of its stock.</p>
<p>Affiliated is the holding company for Lexington Savings Bank and Federal Savings Bank.</p>
</text>
